        <tr><td>SSRI sexual side effects</td><td>15 mg twice daily</td><td>4 weeks</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Everyday mood &amp; stress</td><td>28 mg affron® or 30 mg extract</td><td>4–8 weeks</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p>Notice that most of these trials used <strong>15 mg twice daily</strong>. A 15 mg product makes that easy, and the <a href="/tools/saffron-dosage-calculator/">dosage calculator</a> works it out for any capsule size.</p>
